Error [jet.InvalidScopedPolicy]: `#FX` cannot attach to a function
  --> tests/ui/effects/fx_on_function_is_e0355.jet:3:1
    |
  3 | #FX(IO)
    | ^^^^^^^
 Why: `#FX(…)` caps a block or a module; a function states its limit in its effect row
 Fix: Write the limit in the function's row, such as `show: fn() -[IO]> { … }`, or put `#FX(…)` on a block inside it
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0355
